## Git workflow

<!-- {{IF HAS_GIT}} -->
- Use feature branches; do not commit directly to `main`/`master`.
- Stage files by name only — never `git add -A`/`git add .`/`git add --all`.
- Never force-push to `main`/`master`. Force-pushes to feature branches require explicit user approval.
- Never skip hooks (`--no-verify`) or signing flags unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer creating new commits over `--amend` once a commit is shared.
<!-- {{ENDIF}} -->

